  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Democratization and Human Rights 2023-2026 Project, Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support the Ukraine Recovery Plan and contribute to the promotion of the development and consolidation of democratic societies with respect for human rights, an effective tripartism of state power and strong independent control bodies, where a politically engaged population, an organized and independent civil society and free media can hold authorities accountable  and secure inclusive societies with equality and recognition of diversity.</narrative>
  </description>
